From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Dmitry Afonchenko <undermove1@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 25 Nov 2026 23:00:12 +0400
Subject: [PATCH] Meridian: the call is marked too, and the tab on air can stop
 sharing

During a share the tab of the call that shares wears its own on-air mark
and a softer red wash, apart from the shared tab's ring and monitor. The
monitor on the tab on air opens a menu: back to the call, or Stop sharing;
the on-air mark on the call shows which tab is on air and stops it too.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01SwxrQ2eLfJ2bv8cCoG2va1
